---
source: text/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"colrm\")"
---
Remove columns from a file

Usage: colrm [FIRST] [LAST]

Arguments:
  [FIRST]  First column to remove (1-based)
  [LAST]   Last column to remove (1-based, inclusive)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
